# Model & Config Rules

## Adding a Model
1. `src/model/my_model.py` — `nn.Module` subclass
2. `configs/model/my_model.yaml` — `_target_: model.my_model.MyModel`
3. `configs/experiment/<task>/my_experiment.yaml` — reference model in `defaults:`
4. Update `src/model/README.md` and `src/model/ARCHITECTURE.md`

## GAN Mode
Model must be `ModuleDict({"generator": ..., "discriminator": ...})`. Trainer auto-switches to `batch_loop_gan()` when `mode: "gan"`.

## Building Blocks
Prefer reusing `src/model/blocks/` over custom implementations.
